---
import '../../styles/global.css';
import '../../styles/about.css';
import Footer from '../../components/footer.astro';
import Layout from '../../layouts/layout.astro';
---
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Bio</title>

    <link
            rel="preload"
            as="image"
            href="/about_bg.jpg"
            fetchpriority="high"
    />

    <link
            rel="preload"
            as="image"
            href="/foto_about.jpg"
            fetchpriority="high"
    />
</head>

<Layout>
    <style>
        .about-page {
            background-image: url('/about_bg.jpg');
        }
    </style>

    <main class="about-page">
        <div class="about-grid">

            <div class="img_about">
                <img
                        src="/foto_about.jpg"
                        alt="Ritratto di Nico Bonanno"
                        width="500"
                        height="500"
                        loading="eager"
                        fetchpriority="high"
                />
            </div>

            <div class="bio">
                <p>
                    Born, raised, and still living in Novara, I have nurtured a deep passion for the visual arts over the years.
                    <br><br>
                    Particularly drawn to cinema and photography, I began taking the latter seriously during my high school years,
                    starting with my first shots using my mother's camera and gradually moving on to experimenting with different techniques and equipment.
                    <br><br>
                    Alongside my artistic journey, I found in political and social activism a space for personal growth and further
                    opportunities to challenge myself. This commitment has also found an artistic expression through my work as a volunteer
                    photographer for projects promoted by Sermais and Libera Novara, both of which I am actively involved in, documenting the v
                    alues and stories of the local community and beyond.
                    <br><br>
                    Today, I continue to pursue this passion, with the goal of improving, learning, and exploring visual languages,
                    while remaining open to every opportunity the future may bring.
                </p>
            </div>

        </div>

        <div class="about-credits">
            <p>
                Website developed by Davide Lanza.<br/>
                Epoch Font by Junhan Sim<br/>
                © Nico Bonanno
            </p>
        </div>

    </main>

</Layout>

